; Links:
;    0: TWdLink(count=6171, event=, unk3=)
;---------------------------------------
; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\yomi2_mixv2.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYMOVIE "平治の乱.wmv" "256" "C" "C" "REPEAT" "FALSE" "0" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n100\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n100\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>May 26 of the year before the Shiyo era began―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
An age when <STYLE ID="1" RUBY="たらのきよもり">Tara no Kiyomori</STYLE> held the reins of power.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even the <STYLE ID="2" RUBY="たら">Tara</STYLE> clan, at the height of its glory, found that <STYLE ID="3" RUBY="じょうしゃひっすい">the prosperous must fall</STYLE>, a <STYLE ID="4" RUBY="ことわり">law</STYLE> it <STYLE ID="5" RUBY="かな">could not</STYLE> escape, and was fated for ruin.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\lcm\以仁王.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "200" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
The Emperor's third son of that time―the Emperor's <STYLE ID="6">prince</STYLE>―was the very man who brought down the <STYLE ID="2" RUBY="たら">Tara</STYLE> clan and set off the dawn of a new age.<PG>
The <STYLE ID="6">Prince's</STYLE> <STYLE ID="7" RUBY="れいし">decree</STYLE>―
{PAUSE ""}
it was an order that, citing outrages such as <STYLE ID="1" RUBY="たらのきよもり">Tara no Kiyomori</STYLE> and his men imprisoning the Emperor, the <STYLE ID="6">Prince's</STYLE> own father, 
{PAUSE ""}
commanded that the <STYLE ID="2" RUBY="たら">Tara</STYLE> clan and all its kin be hunted down, and was issued to the <STYLE ID="8" RUBY="そう">Minato</STYLE> clan and their soldiers.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The <STYLE ID="6">Prince</STYLE> called on the <STYLE ID="8" RUBY="そう">Minato</STYLE> clan in every province to bring down the <STYLE ID="2" RUBY="たら">Tara</STYLE> clan, and launched a coup, but...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="STOPMOVIE">
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1,人物2" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\砂利を歩く2人.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "VOICE" "800" "5000" "PASS"}
The <STYLE ID="6">Prince</STYLE>―aged 29.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9" RUBY="みなとのつなむね">Minato no Tsunamune</STYLE>―aged 28.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="10">Tsunamune's</STYLE> grandfather, like the <STYLE ID="6">Prince</STYLE>, was a man discontented with <STYLE ID="11" RUBY="きよもり">Kiyomori's</STYLE> regime, and he joined hands with the <STYLE ID="6">Prince</STYLE> under the banner of overthrowing the <STYLE ID="2" RUBY="たら">Tara</STYLE> clan.<PG>
But the coup of the <STYLE ID="6">Prince</STYLE> and the <STYLE ID="8" RUBY="そう">Minato</STYLE> clan, too, ended up yielding to <STYLE ID="11" RUBY="きよもり">Kiyomori</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
On May 26 of the year before the Shiyo era began, the <STYLE ID="6">Prince</STYLE> and the rest of the anti-<STYLE ID="2" RUBY="たら">Tara</STYLE> forces were supposed to have been executed or struck down, but―<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\春の山.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "5000" "PASS"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\女神\山2.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="6">"Hah! Hah!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="10">"Ngh...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="12" RUBY="かっちゅう">Armor</STYLE> is of no use at all now.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It is only hot, and heavy.<PG>
<STYLE ID="10">Tsunamune</STYLE> and I have fled the Western Capital and are making our way toward the Eastern Capital.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
How many months has it been now?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There is no one here but me, <STYLE ID="10">Tsunamune</STYLE>, who fought at my side, and a few retainers.<PG>
Among the retainers there is even a girl who is still very young.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
To have been blessed with such devoted retainers is a great joy.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But on the other hand, lives were lost because of it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
How many have spent the last of their strength on this flight.<PG>
Was it a mistake for me to issue the decree?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I resolved to act for those who could not bear <STYLE ID="11" RUBY="きよもり">Kiyomori's</STYLE> tyranny, but―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A son of the Emperor, of all people, is making this sorry spectacle of himself, but even so, I must survive.<PG>
{STOPSND "VOICE" "1000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="6">"All right, that's it for today."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When I call this out, the men all sigh and sit down where they stand.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
We are long past the point where rank means anything.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Whether I am the Emperor's son or a retainer comes of <STYLE ID="13" RUBY="いや">lowly</STYLE> birth, if we lose even one more person, none of us can survive.<PG>
At first, I tried to stay alive for my own sake, to live on and make <STYLE ID="11" RUBY="きよもり">Kiyomori</STYLE>, who imprisoned my father, pay for it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But once summer had passed, autumn had come and we had endured the winter, I no longer had any thought of doing anything about <STYLE ID="11" RUBY="きよもり">Kiyomori</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I live for <STYLE ID="10">Tsunamune</STYLE>, who has followed me this far without a single complaint, and for the retainers.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If I were to give up on living here, what would they have come all this way for?<PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Tsunamune</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">, how far have we come by now?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\頼綱.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="10">"Looks like we've strayed a good way north of the Eastern Capital."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
We have come very deep into the mountains.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But otherwise, not only could we not shake off our pursuers, we might even be attacked by bandits.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Walking these mountains, where we are grateful even for a game trail, is the only way for us to live.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
From late autumn through winter especially, we could not move in the mountains, so we hid in a cave we were lucky to find and simply waited for spring to come.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Now and then we found a deer, or a bear woken from hibernation, and at once all of us hunted it down.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
To us in our hunger, even a fearsome bear was no more than a hide bag stuffed with meat.<PG>
Waiting for the days to grow longer, we set off for the Eastern Capital once more.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There is still snow all around.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It is the season when glimpses of spring warmth can already be seen, but deep in these mountains the snow lingers, and at night the water freezes over with ice like a mirror.<PG>
Everyone, just a little farther.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A little farther east, then straight down to the south, and we will reach the Eastern Capital.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Then <STYLE ID="14" RUBY="みなとのともより">Minato no Tomoyori</STYLE>, the head of the Eastern Capital, will surely take us under his protection.<PG>
"<STYLE ID="6">Your Highness</STYLE>! Something's wrong!
{PAUSE ""}
　It's <STYLE ID="15" RUBY="いとひめ">Itohime</STYLE>...!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
One of the retainers calls out to me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"What is it? What about </STYLE><STYLE ID="16">Itohime</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="16">Itohime</STYLE>, who until a moment ago was walking the mountain path in silence with a big load on her back.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
She is a young retainer, only about 10 years old.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\糸姫.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="16">"Uu... uuu..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Let me see your forehead. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">...A fever... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">Someone, gather some snow!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">　</STYLE><STYLE ID="16">Itohime</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">, it will be all right. We are not walking any more today, so rest easy."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="16">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Your Highness</STYLE><STYLE ID="16">... I'm sorry..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="16">Itohime</STYLE>, her face red, <STYLE ID="17" RUBY="わ">apologizes</STYLE> to me between her ragged breaths.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\金木犀.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{STOPSND "SE" "3000" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\京都思い出.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Even among the retainers, <STYLE ID="16">Itohime</STYLE> is an especially <STYLE ID="13" RUBY="いや">lowly</STYLE>-born <STYLE ID="18" RUBY="おなご">girl</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="16">This girl</STYLE> serves the Emperor's household, yet comes of a family line of especially low rank.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A girl of such low rank that ordinarily she would never even come face to face with me.<PG>
But in that battle, as we fled the Western Capital, I dropped my dagger, and <STYLE ID="16">Itohime</STYLE>, who happened to be nearby, picked it up for me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
On the grounds that she had picked up the dagger, I simply brought her along.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
For <STYLE ID="16">Itohime's</STYLE> parents lay dead right beside her.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Left alone in the world, <STYLE ID="16">Ito</STYLE> has no place to belong anymore.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And if her parents died because of my decree in the first place, then part of the responsibility is mine.<PG>
By rights, she is at an age when she would want to be coddled by grown-ups.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
An age when she would be delighted to <STYLE ID="19" RUBY="な">lick</STYLE> sweet sugar.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
She must long for pretty kimono.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So for <STYLE ID="16">Ito</STYLE>, at <STYLE ID="10">Tsunamune's</STYLE> suggestion, we decided to add 'Hime'―princess―to her name.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So that <STYLE ID="16">Ito's</STYLE> heart might look forward, even just a little.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="16">Ito</STYLE> seems to like it very much, too.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\女神\山2.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"<STYLE ID="6">Your Highness</STYLE>, I've brought it!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
One of the retainers has brought snow, both hands heaped with it.<PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"Good work. </STYLE><STYLE ID="16">Itohime</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">, are you hot? Are you cold?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="16">"H-hot..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Hearing that answer, I press the snow to <STYLE ID="16">Itohime's</STYLE> forehead.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Then <STYLE ID="16">Itohime's</STYLE> stiff face eases, just a little.<PG>
The retainers surround <STYLE ID="16">Itohime</STYLE> and me, staring.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There are six retainers left, eight of us in all with <STYLE ID="10">Tsunamune</STYLE> and me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When we fled the capital there were nearly 20, but all the others have died.<PG>
Then one of the retainers swallows with an audible gulp.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
He is looking at <STYLE ID="16">Itohime</STYLE> as he swallows.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
We have all made one promise to each other.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Everyone knows what will happen if they die.<PG>
Yes, right now <STYLE ID="16">Itohime</STYLE> has fallen ill, and she may die as she is.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Everyone's appetite is stirring for <STYLE ID="16">that person</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="16">Itohime</STYLE> and I, everyone here, know the taste of human flesh.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
To survive this brutal journey, there was no other way.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Some of the retainers refused to eat human flesh.<PG>
But they all died and became our flesh and blood.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The only ones here are those who clung to life hard enough to eat human flesh.<PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"C-come on, what are you doing! Everyone, gather snow and boil some water!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Brought back to their senses by my voice, the retainers scatter in all directions.<PG>
<STYLE ID="16">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Your Highness</STYLE><STYLE ID="16">... I, too..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="16">Itohime</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">, you lie down and rest."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="16">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Your Highness</STYLE><STYLE ID="16">... I am still small, but... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="16">will everyone's stomachs be full?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="16">Itohime</STYLE> is prepared to become everyone's flesh and blood.<PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="16">Itohime</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">, </STYLE><STYLE ID="16">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> are so small there is nothing on you to eat. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">If you die, you die for nothing. So you must not die."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When I say this to her, <STYLE ID="16">Itohime</STYLE> slowly closes her eyes and nods.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
Has my small encouragement put her at ease?<PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="20">"Waaah! A monster deer!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I hear a retainer's scream from far off.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And not the roar of one who has found prey, but the shriek of one being chased by it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I stand and take up my weapon, now covered in <STYLE ID="21" RUBY="さび">rust</STYLE>.<PG>
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\箱からの脱出.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="6">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="16">Itohime</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">, stay here!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\砂利を走る.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "800" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\女神\林走る.gal" "NORMAL" "32" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
A deer is the finest feast there is for us.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The bigger it is, the more tempting the game, and yet he is so terrified he is screaming.<PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"What is this thing...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "1000" "PASS"}
