{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
A body as huge as a bear's, and antlers that spread like lightning.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I have never seen a deer this enormous.<PG>
Soon the retainers come running all at once and surround the monster deer.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The only one who has not come is the one who went to look farther off.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Now that it has come to this, bear or boar, it is sure to become our food.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
