{QUAKESTOP "500"}
{MESON "500"}
Suddenly, a deer about twice as huge again bursts in.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And it charges the smaller deer (which is still abnormally big).<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\SE\突き飛ばす大.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\肉付き\吐血1.gal" "NORMAL" "12" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
The impact sends the small deer flying high into the air.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Thrown upward so hard it cannot even let out a death cry, the deer sprays blood in every direction, like a volcano spewing fire.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\女神\山2.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
The deer, fallen on the ground, can only lie there <STYLE ID="22" RUBY="けいれん">twitching</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Its insides seem to have been completely crushed.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The giant deer that attacked, perhaps satisfied with the other's death, gives it a <STYLE ID="23" RUBY="いちべつ">glance</STYLE> and then leaves, showing no interest in us.<PG>
Did this deer trespass on that giant deer's territory?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Either way, without any trouble at all, we have gotten more venison than we could ever need.<PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\春の山.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "3000" "PASS"}
"<STYLE ID="6">Your Highness</STYLE>! Over here, over here!
{PAUSE ""}
　I found something incredible!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It seems the one retainer who did not help surround the deer has come back.<PG>
"Wh... whoa! That's one incredible deer... 
{PAUSE ""}
