{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
His face does not show even a trace of fatigue.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Apparently it is a find to rival this deer.<PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"All right, lead the way. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">Everyone else, carry the deer and look after </STYLE><STYLE ID="16">Itohime</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">."</STYLE><PG>
