{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
This is a strange place indeed.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Two monstrous deer turned up, and now he says there is something remarkable enough to rival them.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Perhaps we have stepped into some mysterious realm where no one has ever set foot.<PG>
Little by little, a heat that makes us sweat begins to fill the air around us.<PG>
