{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="6">"A hot spring..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Steam so thick it could be mistaken for fog rises from hot water flowing like a river.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even in these chilly early-spring mountains, the damp, pleasant heat brings out a sweat.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If <STYLE ID="16">Itohime</STYLE> rests near here, she should recover faster.<PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"All right, let's move everyone here."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
Hearing that hot water is welling up, everyone forgets their fatigue and carries the baggage, the big deer, and <STYLE ID="16">Itohime</STYLE> to the edge of the hot spring.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\温泉夜.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
―Before long the sun sets, and moonlight wraps everything around us.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Usually everyone would fall asleep, worn out, but today is different.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Everyone feasts on the big deer's meat and throws themselves into the endlessly welling hot water to soothe their fatigue.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Who could have imagined there was a paradise like this deep in the mountains?<PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"Say, </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Tsunamune</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\頼綱.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="10">"What is it?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"What would you say to staying here a while longer?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">　Even if we go on to the Eastern Capital, it can wait until </STYLE><STYLE ID="16">Itohime's</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> strength and everyone's spirits have recovered."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="10">"But the pursuers..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"I cannot imagine pursuers coming this deep into the mountains, where there are not even bandits. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">Besides, the Eastern Capital, where </STYLE><STYLE ID="24" RUBY="ともより">Tomoyori</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> is, is more likely to catch </STYLE><STYLE ID="25" RUBY="きよもり">Kiyomori's</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> eye. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">If anything, I think it is safer here..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="10">"Meaning... you're thinking of putting down roots here, too?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"I would not go that far. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">But looking at everyone's faces, I just thought this might be a more comfortable place than either the Eastern or the Western Capital."</STYLE><PG>
Everyone is frolicking in the hot water and savoring the meat, and <STYLE ID="16">Itohime</STYLE> has recovered enough to sit up.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I certainly hate <STYLE ID="11" RUBY="きよもり">Kiyomori</STYLE> and his people, who imprisoned my father.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But is there any need to drag the retainers, who have worked themselves to the bone following me, through any more of this brutal journey?<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "3000" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\最後の声から\星空.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
―With full bellies and our fatigue soothed by the hot water, all that is left is to sleep.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="10">Tsunamune</STYLE>, <STYLE ID="16">Itohime</STYLE> and all the others begin to breathe the calm breaths of sleep.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In the clear night sky, the moonlight, veiled in silky steam, is dazzling.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What would the view of the foothills look like from here?<PG>
{PLAYSND "SE\砂利を歩く.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
I go a little way upstream and make my way to a rise that overlooks the whole area.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It may be my imagination, but I sense a vivid light reflecting the moonlight from the foot of the mountain.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
After about 50 paces, I find a rock of just the right size.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When I climb up onto it―<PG>
{STOPSND "VOICE" "1000" "PASS"}
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
