<BR>
<STYLE ID="16">Itohime's</STYLE> illness, which I thought would take at least another week, has cleared up before a single night has passed.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This really is a strange place.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\イラスト\エデンの桜編\あらたな村\横向き.lcm" "REPEAT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="6">"Those are cherry blossoms. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">This mountain makes a great many cherry trees bloom all around it, and raises those huge animals. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">It is a mountain like a blessing from the gods."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
