{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="16">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Your Highness</STYLE><STYLE ID="16">, I love this place!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="16">Itohime</STYLE> turns to me with a smile as bright as the moon and colored like the cherry blossoms.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That smile of <STYLE ID="16">Itohime's</STYLE> is one she has never shown me before, carefree, as befits her age.<PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="16">Itohime</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">, would you like to live here?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\イラスト\エデンの桜編\あらたな村\エデンの桜編正面驚き.gal" "REPEAT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="16">"............!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\イラスト\エデンの桜編\あらたな村\正面.lcm" "REPEAT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
　<STYLE ID="16">No. When </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Your Highness</STYLE><STYLE ID="16"> is trying to go to the Eastern Capital, I cannot do that. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">Your Highness</STYLE><STYLE ID="16">, wherever you go is where I belong."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Then what if I said I would live here?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\イラスト\エデンの桜編\あらたな村\エデンの桜編正面閉じ.gal" "REPEAT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="16">"Then this is my place to belong. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="16">For I am always with </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Your Highness</STYLE><STYLE ID="16">."</STYLE><PG>
