<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\頼綱.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
And the retainers, who should have been asleep, start climbing onto the rock one after another.<PG>
"What a view!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Looks like we could live a long life if we stayed here!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Well, let's get plenty of rest before we head out!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The lively voices of retainers who, until we caught the deer, had eyes like the dead.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Perhaps what I seek is not in the Eastern Capital.<PG>
Even without my strength, <STYLE ID="26" RUBY="ともより">Tomoyori</STYLE> will surely defeat <STYLE ID="11" RUBY="きよもり">Kiyomori</STYLE> and his people and build a new world.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It is better that I be counted as dead now.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That way I will cause <STYLE ID="26" RUBY="ともより">Tomoyori</STYLE> no trouble, and above all, I can give these retainers a lasting peace.<PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Tsunamune</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">, I want to give this land a name."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="10">"A name for this land...?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="10">　Let me see... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="10">It's a place like paradise. Rice would surely grow well here, too. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="10">Heaven's field―how about '</STYLE><STYLE ID="27" RUBY="あまた">Amata</STYLE><STYLE ID="10">'?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Amata... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">Hm... It is not bad, but..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I feel a slight unease about the name.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What if a name that sweet lured in heartless people who set their sights on us...<PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Tsunamune</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">, let's go the other way. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">I want to give it an unappealing name, and make it a paradise nobody comes to disturb. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">All right... a ruined field―how about '</STYLE><STYLE ID="28" RUBY="あらた">Arata</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">'?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">　</STYLE><STYLE ID="29" RUBY="あまた">Amata</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="28" RUBY="あらた">Arata</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> sound alike, too."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="10">"Hahaha! Now THAT is an unappealing name!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="10">　Fine, why not! Arata it is!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When <STYLE ID="10">Tsunamune</STYLE> shouts this, the retainers, too, burst into cheers.<PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"And I would like a name for this mountain, too, where we can look out on this beautiful view."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="10">"Let's see, then... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="16">Itohime</STYLE><STYLE ID="10">, what do you think? What name would you like?"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\イラスト\エデンの桜編\あらたな村\エデンの桜編正面驚き.gal" "REPEAT" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物2" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="16">"What!? For me to do such a thing..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Never mind that. Give it a name of your own, </STYLE><STYLE ID="16">Itohime</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="16">"Um, um..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
For a while, <STYLE ID="16">Itohime</STYLE> fidgets with her hands.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
For one who has worked as a retainer, this kind of thing may not come easily.<PG>
<STYLE ID="16">"Um... </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Your Highness</STYLE><STYLE ID="16">... I cannot think of a very good name..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"All right, then how about </STYLE><STYLE ID="30" RUBY="いとひめやま">Mount Itohime</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="16">"What!? My name!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"That is right. This mountain cured </STYLE><STYLE ID="16">Itohime's</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> illness, so let us give it </STYLE><STYLE ID="16">Itohime's</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> name."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="16">"Y-yes... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="16">Um... um... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\イラスト\エデンの桜編\あらたな村\エデンの桜編正面笑顔.gal" "REPEAT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="16">I am so very happy..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\イラスト\エデンの桜編\あらたな村\エデンの桜編正面閉じ.gal" "REPEAT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
At the smile <STYLE ID="16">Itohime</STYLE> shows, shy, with her head lowered, everyone smiles too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="16">Itohime's</STYLE> smile, tinged cherry-pink―the sight of it makes up my mind as well.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\イラスト\エデンの桜編\あらたな村\横向き.lcm" "REPEAT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="6">"This is a place that is getting a new name. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">So... I, too, will no longer be the Prince, and will go by another name. </STYLE>
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\イラスト\エデンの桜編\あらたな村\正面.lcm" "REPEAT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">And I will build a new village here. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">We will build a place where everyone here, and our descendants, can live in peace for all </STYLE><STYLE ID="31" RUBY="えいごう">eternity</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">Let us make a new village in the land of Arata."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\イラスト\エデンの桜編\あらたな村\エデンの桜編正面驚き.gal" "REPEAT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="16">"Then, </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Your Highness</STYLE><STYLE ID="16">! We are...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="16">Itohime</STYLE> stands up and gazes at me with sparkling eyes.<PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="16">Itohime</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">, </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Tsunamune</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">, and all of you, you have truly served me well until now. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">It is only because all of you were here that I was able to survive this far. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">From now on, I want to repay that debt to all of you, and have you rest easy in this land. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">You all gave yourselves for me, so I will give myself for all of you. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">One for all, all for one."</STYLE><PG>
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\イラスト\エデンの桜編\あらたな村\エデンの桜編正面笑顔.gal" "REPEAT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1,人物2" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Shiyo 1, April 8―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A new settlement was born in this land.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Amid the mountains that nurture great beasts and cherry trees in full bloom: a man who cast off his rank and called himself <STYLE ID="32" RUBY="にいむら">Niimura</STYLE>, and his companions.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In time, humble houses came to stand in rows, and there followed more than 300 years of peace.
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
